WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 51 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Wait, hold up. Did the Grand Duchess just call me a fiance?

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
You insolent little wedge. Since when did you have anything to do with House Valmont?

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Watch your tongue, Mordric. Unless you want to see how fast a wench can turn your precious castle into a funeral pyre.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Aris and I have been betrothed since the day we were born. He's under my protection. That's all you need to know.

5
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Gorgon's in no shape to fight right now. Hold position, watch and wait.

6
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.000
What a gorgeous little thing. A damn waste to see her settle for a piece of trash like Aris.

7
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.000
How surprising. For a Grand Duchess? Her taste is certainly unique.

8
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.000
She didn't even acknowledge me!

9
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:54.700
This presence, it's overwhelming. And my heart, why is it racing like this?

10
00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:59.700
The Seraphina wielding six elements doesn't give you the right to act like you own the realm. Grand Duke Vane is...

11
00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:11.420
...Jesus.

12
00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:17.420
So, you're the one my mother picked out for me. Let me see if you're actually worth the trip.
